&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Alchimiste.html&quot; title=&quot;L&amp;#39;alchimiste&quot;&gt;Alchimiste&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt; L’alchimiste ajoute +10 minutes &#224; la dur&#233;e de ses &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Alchimiste.html#MUTAGENES&quot; title=&quot;L&amp;#39;alchimiste&quot;&gt;mutag&#232;nes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des races (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
